      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "*Pant* *pant...*"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_027#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Come on, Penguins!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Looks like you two get along great?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_027#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Grr!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#3",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "What'd I ever do to you?! I'll clock you one!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gah! Whose side are you on?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It- it wasn't me! It was that angel!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Oopsie. I missed. Seems fine though."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Get 'em, while they're—— Agh! What are you choppin' at me for?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sorry, but I gotta stay loyal to the boss!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Me too!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What are you doing on the ground? Get up and fight if you ain't dead!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Y- yessir!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "You can't be so rough with your employees. Do they at least get hazard pay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "It's kind of hard to tell who's who. Just try to get everyone wearing black on the ground."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "Hoo yeah this is a mess."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Sure is—— woah! Mostima?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "But it looks like you're all doing okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "When did you get here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "The boss called me."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_027#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey, it's that weird-lookin' Sankta."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Get outta here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "Somebody needs to calm down a bit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "What are you even fighting over here? Let's all take a step back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She stopped the boss?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No! It's that staff! Look out, boss! She's a caster!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_027#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Looks like we were right not to take her head on... Hey, don't get near 'em!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I ain't never seen a Sankta like you before. Or wait? Are you a Sarkaz? What the hell are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "I'm just an ordinary Messenger."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Cazzata!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Grrr——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "Time for an intermission... or are you not going to listen to me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who do you think you are?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How are you all doing? It's been a long time, hasn't it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey! Eyes over here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#3",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "A couple years, I think? Maybe a couple months?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "When your days are as rich and full as ours, you kinda lose track of time."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "It's been about four years and three months, Mostima."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "Yeah, that's pretty long."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "Don't give me that face. If you keep looking that gloomy I'll think you've gotten sick."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Isn't this a touching reunion?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "Touching or not, it's definitely not the time to be reminiscing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Are you really going to do it here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "I'll do only what needs doing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "...Okay. Just go easy on them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "Don't worry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "And it looks like I've got another customer waiting."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "——?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "No matter how many times I see it, I'm always impressed how Mostima will wave her staff around all light and subtle, only to have some big amazing thing come out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "The mobsters're already scared stiff!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Phew. I guess I should plug a couple of them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "What's wrong? Are we done?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You may have some moves, but you can bet I'm not lettin' you stroll outta here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "You don't always have to play the big bad wolf. Just treat this as some after dinner exercise—— Hm."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wh- what's going on? Did this fire just turn solid?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "...seems like Yith is around here somewhere. We better wrap this up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who are you monologing at? Come at me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "You keep losing your temper. That's a really bad look for the head of a family. How are you going to keep control of the situation?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Grrr! This smug attitude of yours really pisses me off!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Arts! Take cover!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We'll take the Penguins. Don't wanna get in your way!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "They're underestimating us. Show them what we can do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "You got it! Yeeeeeeehaw!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "That's Mostima, the Messenger..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "A Messenger... are Messengers really all like this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "...is that the wind?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "...wind?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "Texas! Run! Quick!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "...Right!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey! What's with the earthquake?! What did that caster just do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "Honestly. Old people are so impatient."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You ain't gettin'——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ack——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_027#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey! It's Arts! Let's get outta here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A sandstorm? Here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "char_201_moeshd#5",
      "operatorId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "portraitKey": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "Things're gettin' kinda weird."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "Texas! Over here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "What about Bison and Mostima? Nng!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "The sandstorm cut them off. I'll get them!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Wait, Exusiai!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Every time Mostima's involved, she loses control like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Texas! Mostima! Where are you?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Gah... there's sand in my eyes——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "Don't panic."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerToken": "char_325_bison_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_325_bison",
      "portraitKey": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Mostima!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "Shield yourself from the sand and come with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mostima",
      "speakerToken": "char_213_mostma_1",
      "operatorId": "char_213_mostma",
      "portraitKey": "char_213_mostma",
      "text": "...That's one old man we don't want to provoke within striking range."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The ground... I'm sinking...! It's quicksand! Run! Don't get swallowed up!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Boss! What do we do?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Where are they? Where's Capone?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They ran out under the cover of the sandstorm! We got a few of our guys in their crew..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_031",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Boss! This place is gonna collapse!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Run. We'll get another shot."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_028#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Shit! What the hell happened?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Another shot... hm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rat King",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_034#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Strange... I don't remember you having any shots left."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
